1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,766
The key to frog farming

2
00:00:01,766 --> 00:00:03,166
is surviving the fattening stage

3
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:04,467
One small mistake

4
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:06,433
and over half can die

5
00:00:06,866 --> 00:00:07,700
It all comes down to this

6
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:09,866
Water quality, temperature, and feed

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,133
are all critical

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:12,700
Their weight is on target

9
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:14,366
They're healthy

10
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:16,033
and have put on enough weight

11
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:20,000
The key fattening stage is over

12
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,933
Now we wait until fall to harvest the oil

13
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:30,566
Lewes

14
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:32,833
With 50,000 bucks

15
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:34,266
you could've gone out and had a blast

16
00:00:34,566 --> 00:00:35,300
But you insisted on copying me

17
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,100
Now you're drowning in debt

18
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,166
and working yourself to death

19
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,100
It's alright

20
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,633
I did the same work for you before

21
00:00:44,166 --> 00:00:44,900
Working for myself

22
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,600
is actually easier

23
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:47,433
I can rest when I'm tired

24
00:00:48,133 --> 00:00:49,266
No one will get annoyed

25
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:53,066
and force me to work

26
00:00:53,766 --> 00:00:54,700
I was doing it for your own good

27
00:00:55,266 --> 00:00:55,866
You see

28
00:00:58,066 --> 00:00:59,166
you need to know your limits

29
00:01:00,633 --> 00:01:01,866
You're not cut out for raising forest frogs

30
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,366
Stop dreaming of getting rich overnight

31
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:06,700
Go back to farming the fields

32
00:01:07,366 --> 00:01:08,233
That's better than anything

33
00:01:08,733 --> 00:01:09,000
By the way

34
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,333
I invited a few buyers for dinner tomorrow

35
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,533
Bring my sister and your parents along

36
00:01:15,033 --> 00:01:15,733
No, thanks

37
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,266
I can't leave the farm

38
00:01:17,766 --> 00:01:18,766
Even with my massive farm

39
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,066
I didn't say I couldn't leave

40
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:23,000
You only have a few frogs here

41
00:01:23,033 --> 00:01:24,200
Are you disrespecting me

42
00:01:25,033 --> 00:01:25,733
Fine, I'll go

43
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:27,433
That's more like it

44
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:28,500
Tomorrow at noon

45
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,566
at the best hotel in town, Prosperity Hotel

46
00:01:29,866 --> 00:01:30,466
Don't be late

47
00:01:30,666 --> 00:01:31,600
He just wants to use me

48
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,633
to show off his success

49
00:01:34,366 --> 00:01:35,633
Don't be late

50
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,900
Enjoy it while you can

51
00:01:40,666 --> 00:01:41,600
Once this batch of forest frogs

52
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,300
starts yielding oil

53
00:01:42,866 --> 00:01:43,933
you won't be

54
00:01:43,933 --> 00:01:44,833
laughing anymore
